# Description
`ft_printf` is a custom implementation of the standard C `printf` function.

# Supported Conversions
```bash
%c        # print single character 
%s        # print string
%p        # print pointer address in hexadecimal
%d        # print decimal (base 10) number
%i        # print integer in base 10
%u        # print unsigned decimal (base 10) number
%x        # print number in hexadecimal (base 16) lowercase
%X        # print number in hexadecimal (base 16) uppercase
%%        # print percent sign
```

# Instructions
## Compilation
```bash
make         # build static library libftprintf.a
```
## Clean
```bash
make clean    # delete all object files
make fclean   # delete all object files and libftprintf.a
make re       # rebuild everything (fclean + make)
```

